{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "047shu_403_2_4_047_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0ddcda311f02c0b06b7e9231e9ba4701cac8128880ce7d284ecf692719658c55",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:047shu_403_2_4_047_03_09_a:2_4_047_03_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f698f47fb6a78ea3dbc4c399c9788795da62b5141a96cdc9eefdb9e2f7eefded",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。\n关于前几天那份白色情人节工作的事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_403_2_4_047_03_09_a:2_4_047_03_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b395e6545ff232399704659c83618de82fbd7d4084b210f5a6ae86d7d82d394a",
      "text": "主海报用的照片，居然定成了那一张啊。\n稍微有点意外。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_403_2_4_047_03_09_a:2_4_047_03_09_a:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aca5a2672efcd5ee0d48020048c523a261cb3d0db198684124f80256ea0d1041",
      "text": "想换掉吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_403_2_4_047_03_09_a:2_4_047_03_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4a316a6e5946bda1c4b8c00167916412766c2af6e9b7a98d401586bdf087a09",
      "text": "没有，就这样挺好的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_403_2_4_047_03_09_a:2_4_047_03_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9a7c38c2b1535b540ac11a43dbd22db966c203551f90d15caa4bdad76ab2908",
      "text": "只是我原本以为大家会更喜欢另一张，\n完全没想到会选那一枚。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_403_2_4_047_03_09_a:2_4_047_03_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23d43379b846caec7758d8f8a2abf0231a65df867b4252eb0dac801e43d155ba",
      "text": "不过……说起来在拍摄的时候，\n你也一直竭力推荐那张照片来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_403_2_4_047_03_09_a:2_4_047_03_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2655ed09f3705cb5106f413f375ecc8af11d05a66ec8440ca42f2267416f4b8d",
      "text": "那是一张能展现\n秀先生魅力的照片",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_403_2_4_047_03_09_a:2_4_047_03_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:807fbd8f8473e71aa7b88d445b3d6e984b19f44b604d0aefafd7b7e77feaa697",
      "text": "非常契合\n这次的概念",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_403_2_4_047_03_09_a:2_4_047_03_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0771cc5f1d7e429d6b08f525f7007c1328d14546add98ac07cc75d012f0ff1a",
      "text": "这样啊。既然你都这么说了，那肯定没错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_403_2_4_047_03_09_a:2_4_047_03_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9ff30c111beba8083c8e8ed6c92d5c49343a6b2cc22c2b9430e1f2f03d73842",
      "text": "多亏了你，我才能完成自己平时做不到的挑战。\n等海报张贴出来之后，再一起聊聊反响吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_403_2_4_047_03_09_a:2_4_047_03_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc5666cf9ae6376d9fe6fbda9c09b5d99f633d79bca6abda973f2598c7063546",
      "text": "那就明天见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
